# The station out of reach (frozen: SIGSTOP) as a message goes: 未发送, with why; back in reach, 重试 sends it.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
log do: freeze
# (the station stopped by the command beside the run: outside the app)
wait 2000
tap 发消息
type 断网时发出的消息 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
timeout 180000
until 未发送
shot 1-unsent
log do: thaw
# (the station started again and reached by the core: nothing on screen says so until 重试)
wait 30000
shot 2-thawed
tap =重试
timeout 120000
gone 未发送
gone 正在发送
shot 3-retried
